---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Services"
  description="Work with Ryan Laird through strategic communication, digital strategy and systems, teaching and mentoring, or speaking and collaboration."
>
  <div class="wrap page">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="sl">Services</p>

      <h1>Work with me</h1>

      <p class="lede">
        I work with organisations, teams, students, professionals and event hosts.
        Whether you need to communicate complex work, build a more useful digital
        system, develop skills or invite a contributor, choose the route that fits.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="route-grid">
      <article class="route" id="strategic-communication" data-tone="teal">
        <h2>Strategic communication</h2>

        <p>
          Communication strategy, positioning, content and engagement for
          organisations working with complex scientific, technical,
          environmental or public-interest work.
        </p>

        <p class="for">
          <strong>For:</strong> space, Earth observation, climate and
          sustainability organisations; science and technology businesses;
          research organisations; and mission-led initiatives.
        </p>

        <p class="for">
          Organisation-level projects are delivered through <a href="https://impactorbit.co">Impact Orbit Co.</a>.
        </p>

        <a class="go" href="/services/strategic-communication/">
          Explore strategic communication
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="route" id="digital-strategy-systems" data-tone="violet">
        <h2>Digital strategy &amp; systems</h2>

        <p>
          Practical digital strategy and infrastructure that helps teams publish,
          organise, measure and improve their work—without creating unnecessary
          complexity.
        </p>

        <p class="for">
          <strong>For:</strong> organisations improving their website, content
          operations, information architecture, analytics, workflows or
          automation.
        </p>

        <p class="for">
          Organisation-level projects are delivered through <a href="https://impactorbit.co">Impact Orbit Co.</a>.
        </p>

        <a class="go" href="/services/digital-strategy-systems/">
          Explore digital strategy &amp; systems
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="route" id="teaching-mentoring" data-tone="sky">
        <h2>Teaching &amp; mentoring</h2>

        <p>
          Physics and astronomy tuition, workshops, guest teaching and
          structured one-to-one support for people developing their knowledge,
          communication skills or professional direction.
        </p>

        <p class="for">
          <strong>For:</strong> students, adult learners, early- and
          mid-career professionals, schools, universities, charities, networks
          and professional teams.
        </p>

        <a class="go" href="/services/teaching-mentoring/">
          Explore teaching &amp; mentoring
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="route" id="speaking-collaboration" data-tone="amber">
        <h2>Speaking &amp; collaboration</h2>

        <p>
          Talks, panels, podcasts, media contributions, editorial commissions
          and research or public-engagement collaborations.
        </p>

        <p class="for">
          <strong>For:</strong> conference and event organisers, podcast hosts,
          journalists and editors, universities, public-engagement teams and
          research collaborators.
        </p>

        <a class="go" href="/services/speaking-collaboration/">
          Explore speaking &amp; collaboration
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="block" aria-labelledby="choosing-a-service">
      <h2 id="choosing-a-service">Not sure where to start?</h2>

      <p class="prose">
        Use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>, choose the closest option
        and describe what you have in mind. If another route—or Green Orbit
        Digital—is a better fit, I will say so.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
